<p>Russian forces launched prolonged waves of drones and missiles against Dnipro. Local officials and multiple news reports said the assault lasted about 20 hours and killed between six and 10 people, while injuring dozens. The strikes hit homes, businesses, and energy infrastructure in what Dnipro’s mayor called the largest attack on the city. In the neighboring Zaporizhzhia region, strikes also killed one person and wounded four others in a civilian minibus.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/VkadCOtGrcD8YEZYKsBybAF0-1m12Eg8sXAUzJGm1oBomIa9c1bXCCqGCWKGDopvzspqAHRxsvnBq_qoqctbixi9mpN5-DXx_FnxmDDcGUaP' alt='Debris lies around an apartment building hit by a Russian missile and drone strike.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Rescue work: Rescuers continued searching bombed apartment blocks for survivors and bodies even as strikes were still underway, according to images from Ukraine’s emergency service and local authorities.</li><li>Building struck twice: Authorities said one apartment building in Dnipro was hit twice during the extended assault.</li><li>Regional toll: Outside Dnipro city, six more people were reported wounded across the wider Dnipropetrovsk region, while Zaporizhzhia officials said four people were injured in the minibus strike there.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Borys Filatov, Dnipro mayor: Filatov called the barrage the largest attack on Dnipro and said his deputy was nearly killed in it. (<a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1995102/russia-pounds-ukraines-city-for-20-hours-straight'>Dawn</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/europe/russia-pounds-ukraines-dnipro-for-20-hours-straight-killing-six-people'>Russia pounds Ukraine’s Dnipro for 20 hours straight, killing eight people</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/major-russian-attack-on-ukraine-kills-wounds-dozens/article70904775.ece'>Russia pounds Ukraine’s Dnipro for 20 hours straight, killing eight</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='https://japantoday.com/category/world/russian-forces-pound-ukraine%27s-dnipro-other-areas-killing-10-people'>Russian forces pound Ukraine&#x27;s Dnipro, other areas, killing 10 people</a> - japantoday.com</li><li><a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1995102/russia-pounds-ukraines-city-for-20-hours-straight'>Russia pounds Ukraine’s city for 20 hours straight</a> - dawn.com</li><li><a href='https://www.ukrinform.net/rubric-ato/4116645-russian-attacks-on-dnipro-kill-eight-wound-49.html'>An overnight Russian drone and ballistic missile attack on Dnipro, Ukraine, kills ten people and injures 49 others. (Ukrinform)</a> - ukrinform.net</li></ul>